  Examples of additional Go-derived portions (non-exhaustive; these
  portions and their modifications retain BSD 3-Clause terms in LICENSE_UPSTREAM):
    src/tango/memstats/agent.go
      adapts HTTP profiling helpers from src/net/http/pprof/pprof.go
      for the Tango memory statistics endpoint.
    src/runtime/mgab_prof.go
      adapts allocation profiling from src/runtime/mprof.go to preserve
      the allocating goroutine's stack during GAB buffer refills.
    src/encoding/json/encode_mapconv.go and
    src/encoding/json/v2/encode_mapconv.go
      adapt field discovery from src/encoding/json/encode.go (typeFields)
      for map conversion, with different field selection and tag handling.
    src/runtime/mgabgc.go
      adapts allocation and stack scanning portions from
      src/runtime/malloc.go and src/runtime/mgcmark.go for GAB collection.
    src/runtime/memdebug.go
      adapts stack frame traversal from src/runtime/symtab.go for
      large-allocation diagnostics without allocating during traversal.
